            <description><![CDATA[<h2 style="font:600 15px -apple-system;margin:0 0 6px">Promptr Studio Pro 5.114</h2>
<p style="font:600 13px -apple-system;margin:0 0 4px">Paul</p>
<ul style="font:13px -apple-system;margin:0;padding-left:18px">
<li><b>Talks like a colleague.</b> Paul greets you by name, confirms a task before he starts and tells you in plain words what he is doing.</li>
<li><b>A tab in the settings panel.</b> Open Paul next to Video, Image, Audio and Enhance. He takes over the panel instead of squeezing the window.</li>
<li><b>His own window.</b> Detach Paul into a separate window, for example onto your second screen.</li>
</ul>
<p style="font:600 13px -apple-system;margin:8px 0 4px">Layouts</p>
<ul style="font:13px -apple-system;margin:0;padding-left:18px">
<li><b>Windows included.</b> Saved layouts now remember your windows too, in dual screen as well, and reopen exactly as you left them.</li>
</ul>
<p style="font:600 13px -apple-system;margin:8px 0 4px">Fixes</p>
<ul style="font:13px -apple-system;margin:0;padding-left:18px">
<li>The project name and the buttons in the title bar now sit centered on the bar.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
