        <item>
            <title>5.112</title>
            <pubDate>Sat, 17 Oct 2026 19:39:57 +0000</pubDate>
            <sparkle:version>667</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>5.112</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <description><![CDATA[<h2 style="font:600 15px -apple-system;margin:0 0 6px">Promptr Studio Pro 5.112</h2>
<p style="font:600 13px -apple-system;margin:0 0 4px">New workspace</p>
<ul style="font:13px -apple-system;margin:0;padding-left:18px">
<li><b>Projects at the top.</b> Switch projects from the title bar and see all of them in one overview.</li>
<li><b>Arrange your panels.</b> Place folders, prompt, settings and gallery where you want them, and save your own layouts.</li>
<li><b>Delete or leave cloud folders.</b> Owners can delete a cloud folder for everyone, members can leave it.</li>
</ul>
<p style="font:600 13px -apple-system;margin:8px 0 4px">3D Composer</p>
<ul style="font:13px -apple-system;margin:0;padding-left:18px">
<li><b>Simple view.</b> 3D Paul builds and directs the scene for you, step by step.</li>
<li><b>Directed figures.</b> Figures walk around obstacles, meet, follow, sit down and ride along.</li>
<li><b>Video from the scene.</b> Generate the video right in the composer, with the credits on the button.</li>
</ul>
<p style="font:600 13px -apple-system;margin:8px 0 4px">New models</p>
<ul style="font:13px -apple-system;margin:0;padding-left:18px">
<li><b>Krea 3 Edit.</b> A second model for Replace in inpainting, next to Ideogram 4.5.</li>
<li><b>OmniHuman V2.</b> Turn one image of a person and an audio track into a talking or singing video.</li>
</ul>
<p style="font:600 13px -apple-system;margin:8px 0 4px">Fixes</p>
<ul style="font:13px -apple-system;margin:0;padding-left:18px">
<li>Paul's approval shows the price of all variations, and Stop after approving cancels before anything starts.</li>
<li>New folder and file names also work on Windows.</li>
<li>More of the German interface is translated.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
